<PageTitle>Game Manual</PageTitle>
<h1>Welcome to Dan's Game'</h1>
<h1>How to Play</h1>
<ul>
    <li><b>Goal:</b> Defeat monsters and reach the Exit.</li>
    <li><b>Controls:</b> WASD to move, Space to attack, I to open Inventory.</li>
    <li><b>Tips:</b> Potions restore HP; check each character’s stats before big fights.</li>
</ul>

<p>Use the sidebar to browse <b>Characters</b>, <b>Items</b>, and <b>Notes</b>.</p>

<b>"Don't wish it were easier, wish you were better."</b>
